# ─── FRONTEND (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Normally leave this unset — api.js auto-detects backend from window.location.hostname:
#   localhost        → http://localhost:8000
#   same-WiFi device → http://<host-ip>:8000
#
# Set this ONLY if you need to override (e.g. remote backend or fixed IP):
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
